<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>信息判断 on 安知生 angelife</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/</link><description>Recent content in 信息判断 on 安知生 angelife</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.147.4</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>2009–2026 angelife / 安知生</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 23:45:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2026-06-02 今日總結：一場關於 CI 路徑錯配與特製檔案的搶救複盤</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2026-06-02-%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%90%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%B4%E9%97%9C%E6%96%BC-CI-%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91%E9%8C%AF%E9%85%8D%E8%88%87%E7%89%B9%E8%A3%BD%E6%AA%94%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%90%B6%E6%95%91%E8%A4%87%E7%9B%A4/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 23:45:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2026-06-02-%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%90%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%B4%E9%97%9C%E6%96%BC-CI-%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%91%E9%8C%AF%E9%85%8D%E8%88%87%E7%89%B9%E8%A3%BD%E6%AA%94%E6%A1%88%E7%9A%84%E6%90%B6%E6%95%91%E8%A4%87%E7%9B%A4/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="前言">前言&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>今天發生了一起典型的「本地完美、線上出錯」故障。表面症狀是 GitHub Pages 部署成功但分類頁面只剩下 2 篇文章，而本地 Hugo 編譯顯示一切正常。這篇記錄完整的破案過程，留給未來接手的人參考。&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="一故障現場分類頁面縮水詭異事件">一、故障現場：分類頁面縮水詭異事件&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>上線完成後，taxonomy 頁面（&lt;code>/series/information-judgment/&lt;/code> 等）全部顯示為 0 篇或極少文章，與本地編譯結果差異極大。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>信息源瘦身：为什么关注少一点，判断力更强</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/information-source-slimming/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:50:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/information-source-slimming/</guid><description>信息源不是越多越好。真正有价值的信息环境，应当减少噪音、提高密度，让注意力服务于长期判断。</description></item><item><title>信息质量判断框架：先看来源，再看叙事</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/information-quality-framework/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/information-quality-framework/</guid><description>判断信息质量不能只看观点是否顺耳，而要看来源、证据、叙事方式、利益位置和纠错机制。真正好的信息源，经得起追问。</description></item><item><title>从反邪到反操弄：信息判断与家庭修复</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2014-04-16-ref2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2014-04-16-ref2/</guid><description>从信息判断、情绪操弄、家庭关系和现实支持四个角度，重新整理一套更稳妥的处理框架。</description></item><item><title>从反邪到反操弄：信息判断与家庭修复</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/2014-04-16-ref2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/2014-04-16-ref2/</guid><description>从信息判断、情绪操弄、家庭关系和现实支持四个角度，重新整理一套更稳妥的处理框架。</description></item><item><title>反操弄与家庭支持：简明原则</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2014-04-13-reference/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/2014-04-13-reference/</guid><description>讨论家人陷入高控制关系、情绪操弄或信息骗局时，普通家庭可以如何保持冷静、降低冲突、保护财产与关系。</description></item><item><title>反操弄与家庭支持：简明原则</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/information-judgment/2014-04-13-reference/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/info